---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import PennTellerBadge from '../components/PennTellerBadge.astro';
import ThreeGuarantees from '../components/ThreeGuarantees.astro';
import TestimonialsSection from '../components/TestimonialsSection.astro';
import VideoGrid from '../components/VideoGrid.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
import FAQSection from '../components/FAQSection.astro';
import { weddingTestimonials } from '../data/testimonials';
import { weddingFaqs } from '../data/faqs';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Wedding Magician | Anthony Entertains | Wedding Entertainment"
  description="Dallas' favorite wedding magician and mentalist Anthony Dempsey creates magical moments for your guests during cocktail hours and receptions. Serving Texas and beyond."
  canonicalUrl="https://anthonyentertains.com/wedding-magician"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <Hero
    eyebrow="Wedding Magician & Mentalist"
    headline="Dallas' Favorite **Wedding Magician**"
    subheadline='"For the most magical day of your life!"'
    ctaText="Get a Free Quote"
    ctaHref={`${base}get-a-quote`}
    bgImage="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_152553d3b78a47e19a00fafac5088a01~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1980,h_1124,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Wedding%20Magician_JPG.jpg"
  />

  <!-- Penn & Teller -->
  <PennTellerBadge />

  <!-- Why Hire Section -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label" data-reveal="fade-up">Did you know?</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal="fade-up">Why should we hire a wedding magician?</h2>
      <div class="divider" data-reveal="fade-up"></div>

      <div class="wedding-layout" data-reveal="fade-up">
        <div class="wedding-intro">
          <p>Imagine this. You walk into your wedding venue and see your best friend trying to help your coworkers stump a mind reader. You are startled by a scream of delight from your cousin who just had something vanish from his hands! You look over and see your sorority sisters laughing side by side with your parents! Sound too good to be true? Wedding Magician Anthony Dempsey makes it all possible!</p>
          <p>I always hear the same thing from the guests... "I wish we could've had you for our wedding!"</p>
          <p>Wedding surveys show that after "I do", <strong>81% of guests say that the entertainment is what they remember most</strong> about the wedding they attended.</p>
          <p>Look at it this way: your wedding is likely the biggest party of your lives. No future birthday, anniversary, or graduation could ever measure up to the time and effort you put into your wedding day. Don't you think your wedding guests should be entertained at this incredible celebration? Not everyone likes to dance, which makes a wedding magician a great alternative to ensure those guests still have a great time!</p>
          <p>We've all been to weddings that start off great, but after the ceremony, quickly become boring. The bridal party is taking pictures; leaving your guests to stand around waiting in a room full of people they probably have never met. These people consist of four main groups: Your friends and family, and your partner's friends and family. These people usually don't know each other very well. You're so busy enjoying your wedding day that you don't have time to introduce them all; let Anthony break the ice for you!</p>
          <p>Anthony's close up magic routines are designed to engage your wedding guests and use as many of them as possible with his effects. Not only is this a great way to help people mingle but it also makes your wedding stand out from all the others that they have ever attended!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wedding-side-images">
          <img
            src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_c030b04ccb8645c98b2e4448fc5fd920~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1015,h_670,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/40084f_c030b04ccb8645c98b2e4448fc5fd920~mv2.jpg"
            alt="Wedding magician performing at reception"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_0a6c813cef4444c79858d1b15bd7fa5c~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_6,w_750,h_1139/fill/w_365,h_553,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/40084f_0a6c813cef4444c79858d1b15bd7fa5c~mv2.jpg"
            alt="Anthony Dempsey wedding entertainment"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Does a Wedding Magician Do -->
  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label" data-reveal="fade-up">The Experience</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal="fade-up">What does a wedding magician do?</h2>
      <div class="divider" data-reveal="fade-up"></div>

      <div class="wedding-layout wedding-layout--reverse" data-reveal="fade-up">
        <div class="wedding-intro">
          <p>A wedding magician is essentially an entertaining ice breaker. A wedding magician will go from group to group, performing close-up magic and mentalism in a more intimate setting. The couple can choose to be involved with tricks for their guests if they'd like. This is a really fun way for the wedding couple to acknowledge tables as they're waiting to be released to the buffet.</p>
          <p>Each group gets the option of choosing what they want to see; either sleight of hand, mind reading, or the most popular option- both!</p>
          <p>Some of the most popular effects include reading your guests' minds, sleight of hand, objects appearing and vanishing in someone's hand, amazing card magic, and much more! You'll hear laughter, you'll see smiles, and minds will be blown!</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px;">When does a wedding magician perform?</h2>
          <p>The cocktail hour is typically the time when the bridal party is off taking photos, leaving the guests to play the waiting game while having drinks. This is a crucial time when people usually don't interact with anyone they don't know- allow your wedding magician to introduce the different groups together through the power of laughter and astonishment! Anthony's main goal is to keep the excitement of the day at a peak!</p>
          <p>Already got your pictures out of the way? Not a problem, Anthony offers an after dinner show for the whole crowd! He also offers table to table performances for a more intimate experience. Whatever the request may be, Wedding Magician Anthony Dempsey has the perfect match for your needs!</p>
          <p>After dinner or during the dancing portion of the evening is also a great time for wedding guests to experience some magic. Not everyone dances, so this is a great option for those people to have something fun to do. You can easily find out which option works best for your wedding day by getting in touch with Anthony!</p>
          <div class="cta-inline">
            <a href={`${base}get-a-quote`} class="btn btn--primary">Get a FREE quote</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="wedding-side-images">
          <img
            src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_b88d42eab4124c078dcaad61b76f7d98~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_931,y_0,w_4155,h_4016/fill/w_418,h_405,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Wedding-Magician-Anthony.jpg"
            alt="Wedding-Magician-Anthony.jpg"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_3d1bbbd7ab96425388e7e6f2af7d0f52~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_502,h_335,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/40084f_3d1bbbd7ab96425388e7e6f2af7d0f52~mv2.jpg"
            alt="Wedding magician close up magic"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Wedding Photo Gallery -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label" data-reveal="fade-up">Gallery</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal="fade-up">Anthony Dempsey — WEDDING MAGICIAN</h2>
      <div class="divider" data-reveal="fade-up"></div>
      <div class="wedding-gallery" data-reveal="fade-up">
        <img
          src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_716a548cb3a04d979809ed1676a43b5b~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_263,y_18,w_2463,h_3996/fill/w_285,h_460,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/40084f_716a548cb3a04d979809ed1676a43b5b~mv2.jpg"
          alt="Anthony Dempsey wedding magician performance"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_4faf921d1a3542c881e6dcc1f3546a0e~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_738,y_0,w_2100,h_2397/fill/w_370,h_420,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/40084f_4faf921d1a3542c881e6dcc1f3546a0e~mv2.jpg"
          alt="Wedding magic entertainment Dallas"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_6cd30b947372493e917bcd45bf5f24fb~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_345,h_453,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/40084f_6cd30b947372493e917bcd45bf5f24fb~mv2.jpg"
          alt="Wedding guest enjoying magic show"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_ee2d8884908d4c9b86292f75fd59d648~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_353,h_355,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/40084f_ee2d8884908d4c9b86292f75fd59d648~mv2.jpg"
          alt="Dallas wedding entertainment"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_82567ed63d774692af7956539b3abf19~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_345,h_456,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/40084f_82567ed63d774692af7956539b3abf19~mv2.jpg"
          alt="Wedding reception magician"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_a2d9957c556742708670ae414e88ef57~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_353,h_355,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Dallas%20Magician%20Wedding%20Entertainment%20Ma.jpg"
          alt="Dallas Magician Wedding Entertainment Ma"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_ad24bc9d6c76418585551c9eb91896e7~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_345,h_456,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Dallas%2520Magician%2520for%2520weddings_edite.jpg"
          alt="Dallas%20Magician%20for%20weddings_edite"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_4a7c7d26f0574438a420ffcfb60cf05d~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_353,h_355,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Wedding%20Magician%20Fort%20Worth%20Texas.jpg"
          alt="Wedding Magician Fort Worth Texas.jpg"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_924e094da7ee43d2ae1b1766b87b3f0e~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_331,h_490,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/40084f_924e094da7ee43d2ae1b1766b87b3f0e~mv2.jpg"
          alt="Wedding magician strolling magic"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/40084f_b300fdc67ab3412ab65e19b5c8a69561~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_113,h_76,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/40084f_b300fdc67ab3412ab65e19b5c8a69561~mv2.jpg"
          alt="Dallas-Wedding-Magician-Anthony-Dempsey."
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Guarantees -->
  <ThreeGuarantees
    label="The Key to a Truly Memorable Wedding"
    title="Anthony Guarantees:"
  />

  <!-- Testimonials -->
  <TestimonialsSection
    testimonials={weddingTestimonials}
    title="Couples Who Loved Anthony's Wedding Entertainment"
  />

  <!-- Videos -->
  <VideoGrid />

  <!-- Contact -->
  <ContactForm
    title="What are you waiting for? Lets talk about your big day!"
    label="Contact Us"
    showFullForm={true}
  />

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <FAQSection
    title="When choosing a Wedding Magician, I know you have questions. I have answers."
    faqs={weddingFaqs}
  />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.wedding-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 340px;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
}

.wedding-layout--reverse {
  grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr;
}

.wedding-layout--reverse .wedding-intro {
  order: 2;
}

.wedding-layout--reverse .wedding-side-images {
  order: 1;
}

.wedding-side-images {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
}

.wedding-side-images img {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: 4px;
  display: block;
}

.wedding-intro {
  max-width: 800px;
}
.wedding-intro p {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--c-dark-base);
  line-height: 1.85;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  max-width: none;
}
.wedding-intro strong {
  color: var(--c-brand-navy);
}

.cta-inline {
  margin-top: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.wedding-gallery {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  gap: 16px;
}

.wedding-gallery img {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  border-radius: 4px;
  object-fit: cover;
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .wedding-layout,
  .wedding-layout--reverse {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .wedding-layout--reverse .wedding-intro,
  .wedding-layout--reverse .wedding-side-images {
    order: unset;
  }
  .wedding-intro { max-width: 100%; }
  .wedding-gallery {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr));
  }
}
</style>
